==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰreg-}}
From {{der|en|la|refrāctum}}, neuter form of {{m|la|refrāctus}}, the past participle of {{m|la|refringō}}, itself from {{m|la|re-|t=again}} + {{m|la|frangō|t=I break}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ækt}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive|of light}} To change [[direction]] as a result of entering a different [[medium]]
# {{lb|en|transitive|optics}} To cause (light) to change direction as a result of entering a different medium.
#: {{ux|en|A prism can '''refract''' light.}}

